157
00:09:04,920 --> 00:09:07,590
所以...不是谢尔顿  就是蓝精灵的格格巫
so...It's either Sheldon or Gargamel from The Smurfs.

158
00:09:08,930 --> 00:09:09,930
混蛋
What a jerk.

159
00:09:10,140 --> 00:09:12,260
你擅长报复  我们该怎么治治他
You're good at revenge; how do we get him back?

160
00:09:12,430 --> 00:09:16,180
我的必杀技通常是睡那人的男朋友
Well, my go-to move is usually sleep with the person's boyfriend,

161
