你尽管好好休息放松  一切都包在我身上
You just kick back and relax.I've got it all under control.

184
00:10:42,850 --> 00:10:45,900
本来就有人承包这一切事宜了
Although it was already under control.

185
00:10:46,690 --> 00:10:48,780
不好意思  你嘟囔的啥我没听清
I'm sorry, you mumbled something?

186
00:10:50,700 --> 00:10:53,490
我只是说他们本来也有人帮忙
It's just that they've had plenty of help.

187
00:10:53,870 --> 00:10:56,080
俗语说得好  "举全村之力  养好一个娃"
Well, you know what they say:it takes a village.

188
00:10:56,370 --> 00:10:58,450
他们早有全村人  用不着你
Well, they already had a village.

189
00:10:59,750 --> 00:11:02,620
我怎么没见全村人抽空把婴儿床装好呢
I noticed the village couldn't find time to put the crib together.

190
00:11:03,330 --> 00:11:05,540
没准全村人都忙着为新生儿
Yeah, well, maybe the village was too busy

191
00:11:05,750 --> 00:11:08,170
调查本地蒙特梭利早教中心的口碑好不好
checking out the local Montessori school for the new arrival.

192
00:11:08,340 --> 00:11:10,420
你是说儿童沙坑里有空啤酒瓶的那家吗
You mean the one with the empty beer bottles in the sandbox?

193
