你竟堕落到如此地步
This is the level you're stooping to.

198
00:11:33,910 --> 00:11:38,580
不  这才是我要堕落到的地步
No. This is the level I am stooping to.

199
00:11:43,210 --> 00:11:46,750
公寓旗移至股间4格  将军
I believe that is flag to crotch four, checkmate.

200
00:11:48,750 --> 00:11:51,380
轻松舒爽  胯下惠风和畅
Easy-peasy, ooh, so breezy.

201
00:12:02,020 --> 00:12:03,140
有何贵干
Hey, what's up?

202
00:12:03,350 --> 00:12:04,440
我是来装婴儿床的
I'm here to put the crib together.

203
00:12:04,600 --> 00:12:06,440
不好意思  我已经装好了
Ooh, sorry, I already did it.

204
00:12:07,400 --> 00:12:10,270
我觉得你可能没意识到这点  但那婴儿床是我买的
Oh, I don't know if you realize this,but I bought that crib.

205
00:12:10,480 --> 00:12:14,530
我在"谁特么鸟你网"上看到了
Oh, yeah, I read about that on WhoGivesACrap.Com

206
00:12:16,490 --> 00:12:18,410
你为什么要对我百般刁难
Why are you being like this?

207
