因为我爱霍华德和伯纳黛特
Because I love Howard and Bernadette

208
00:12:21,120 --> 00:12:23,790
如果我想死赖着不走  我得帮得上忙
and if I want to keep mooching off them, I need to be helpful.

209
00:12:24,500 --> 00:12:27,290
在你来之前  这个孕期早就被我
Hey, this pregnancy had an emotionally-needy

210
00:12:27,500 --> 00:12:29,090
这个情感空虚的电灯泡承包了
third wheel way before you came along.

211
00:12:31,050 --> 00:12:32,800
谁规定电灯泡只能有一个
Why can't there be four wheels?

212
00:12:33,590 --> 00:12:36,760
我不在的时候  你就是这么争宠的吗  你个说话句句在理的狐媚子
Is this what you do when I'm not here,make really good points?

213
00:12:37,640 --> 00:12:41,220
好吧  进来帮我给宝宝搭个秋千吧
Look-Look, just come in and help me build a baby swing.

214
00:12:41,390 --> 00:12:42,470
谢谢
Thank you.

215
00:12:43,310 --> 00:12:46,310
你如果饿了可以吃你昨晚买的外卖没人稀罕吃
If you're hungry you can eat your takeout,nobody touched it.

216
00:12:49,150 --> 00:12:50,900
我想去跑步  你想一起来吗
I think I'm gonna go for a run.You want to come?

217
00:12:51,070 --> 00:12:54,240
不去  上次公园里那个老太太一直大喊
No, last time that old lady in the park kept screaming,

218
00:12:54,400 --> 00:12:56,070
"妹子小心  那变态马上要追上你了"
"Watch out, he's right behind you."

219
00:13:01,200 --> 00:13:04,200
-您好  -你们好啊
-Hello?  -Hey, how you doing?

220
00:13:06,500 --> 00:13:08,580
您有什么事吗
Uh, can I help you?

221
00:13:08,750 --> 00:13:11,340
我没什么事  不过谢谢你好心询问
I don't think so, but you're sweet for asking.

222
00:13:08,750 --> 00:13:11,340
这位演员其实是《回到未来》系列电影里的主角之一

223
00:13:12,920 --> 00:13:14,960
你在我们公寓里做什么
What-What are you doing in our apartment?

224
00:13:15,170 --> 00:13:17,880
你们邻居租了间房给我
Oh, I rented a room from your neighbor,

225
00:13:18,590 --> 00:13:21,850
高瘦得像电线杆 穿着像未成年小宅男那个
the tall guy...dressed like a little boy.

226
00:13:24,060 --> 00:13:28,600
难以置信  好吧  我不知道他是怎么跟您说的  但您不能住在这
Unbelievable.Okay, uh, I don't know what he told you,but you can't stay here.

227
00:13:28,890 --> 00:13:32,440
床单已经都换成新的了
So, there are fresh linens on the bed and...

228
00:13:32,770 --> 00:13:35,030
看来你们已经见过西奥多了
Well, now, I see you've met Theodore.

229
00:13:36,490 --> 00:13:40,360
西奥多  这两个是你的新室友  莱纳德和佩妮
Theodore, these are your new roommates,Leonard and Penny.

230
00:13:40,530 --> 00:13:43,450
他们为人忠厚  但还是建议你把现金都收好
They're very honest,but I would not leave cash lying around.

231
00:13:44,990 --> 00:13:46,830
谢尔顿  你这是在做些什么
Sheldon, what do you think you're doing?

232
00:13:47,000 --> 00:13:48,960
这个月的房租我已经付过了
My room is paid up until the end of the month,

233
00:13:49,210 --> 00:13:51,080
所以我想怎么样就怎么样
so I can do with it whatever I please,

234
00:13:51,330 --> 00:13:53,960
包括以一块钱一晚的价格租出去
which includes renting it out for a dollar a night.

235
00:13:54,170 --> 00:13:56,090
房价一夜回到解放前
It's like the '40s again.

236
00:13:59,680 --> 00:14:02,890
好了  我不打扰你们了  我还得去
Anyway, I'll leave you be.I have to...

237
00:14:03,220 --> 00:14:05,310
他希望早上能有报纸看
He's expecting a newspaper in the morning.

238
00:14:05,510 --> 00:14:07,520
原来这年头还有人在印报纸呢
Apparently, they still make them.

239
00:14:08,230 --> 00:14:10,230
谢尔顿  你这么做太过份了
All right, Sheldon, this is over the line.

240
00:14:10,440 --> 00:14:13,310
没错  但如果我不这么过份
That's true,but had I done something under the line,

241
00:14:13,480 --> 00:14:16,730
你们厨房里就不会出现一个身上什么身份证明都没有的陌生人了
there wouldn't be a man in your kitchen who can't produce a single form of ID.

242
00:14:16,940 --> 00:14:18,900
我有张卖血的收据
Oh, oh, I have a receipt from a blood bank.

243
00:14:19,900 --> 00:14:21,780
我是O型阴性血
I'm O-negative.

244
00:14:25,740 --> 00:14:28,160
现在你们对他的了解我和一样多了
And now you know as much about him as I do.

245
00:14:31,870 --> 00:14:36,420
伯纳黛特 这个秋千送了两种转动玩具
Oh, hey, Bernadette,the swing comes with two different mobiles.

246
00:14:36,630 --> 00:14:39,260
这些长颈鹿挺可爱的  你觉得呢
The giraffes are pretty cute, what do you think?

247
00:14:39,590 --> 00:14:41,220
挺好  就用长颈鹿吧
Great, go with the giraffes.

248
00:14:41,430 --> 00:14:43,930
然而...斑马身上对比鲜明的条纹
Although...the high contrast of zebra stripes

249
00:14:44,100 --> 00:14:46,760
可能能更好地刺激宝宝发育
might provide better stimulus for a developing baby.

250
00:14:48,770 --> 00:14:51,100
说得有道理  还是选斑马吧
Yeah, you're probably right, go with the zebras.

251
00:14:51,440 --> 00:14:52,730
太有眼光了  大佬
Good choice, boss.

252
00:14:55,820 --> 00:14:57,730
至少我的鼻子不是因为拍马屁才变棕色的
At least my nose is naturally brown.

253
00:14:55,820 --> 00:14:57,730
棕色鼻子  意为马屁精跪舔菊花的时候鼻子沾到...

254
00:15:02,110 --> 00:15:04,160
你能替我去趟超市吗
Hey, could you please go to the market for me?

255
00:15:04,740 --> 00:15:06,450
让斯图尔特或拉杰去嘛
Get Stuart or Raj to do it.

256
00:15:06,780 --> 00:15:09,160
华仔  他俩替你代劳了所有事
Howie, they've been doing everything for you.

257
00:15:09,370 --> 00:15:12,420
我知道  让我越来越看不起这两个家伙了
Mm, I know.It's really making me lose respect for both of them.

258
00:15:14,040 --> 00:15:15,790
你就去一趟嘛
Please just go to the store.

259
00:15:16,500 --> 00:15:17,500
好吧
Fine.

260
00:15:18,960 --> 00:15:20,760
有人要载我去买东西不
Who wants to drive me to the store?

261
00:15:20,970 --> 00:15:22,130
-我去  -我去
- Me! - I'll do it!

262
00:15:22,720 --> 00:15:25,050
带拉杰去  斯图尔特要帮我涂脚指甲油
Take Raj.Stuart is supposed to paint my toenails.

263
00:15:37,980 --> 00:15:39,820
你怎么看  我们应该去住酒店吗
What do you think? Should we go to a hotel?

264
00:15:39,980 --> 00:15:41,650
把他单独留在家里吗
And just leave him here alone?

265
00:15:41,860 --> 00:15:46,120
也对  那我自己住酒店  如果明早你还没死  记得短信通知我
Okay, I'll go to a hotel.Text me in the morning if you're still alive.

266
00:15:48,780 --> 00:15:53,080
西奥多  你打算在这里住多久
Uh, Theodore,how long are you planning to stay exactly?

267
00:15:53,250 --> 00:15:57,590
多亏了我在你家沙发里找到的硬币  比我想象中又多了一天
Oh, thanks to the coins I found in your couch,a day longer than I thought.

268
00:15:58,920 --> 00:16:00,710
实在是太不像话了
This is ridiculous.

269
00:16:03,590 --> 00:16:07,430
我好喜欢这幅画  另一个人是你妈吗
I like the painting.Is that your mom?

270
00:16:12,480 --> 00:16:14,560
谢尔顿  给我出来
Sheldon, get out here!

271
00:16:15,850 --> 00:16:17,350
你小声点好不好
Will you keep it down?

272
00:16:17,560 --> 00:16:20,690
你当我这儿开的是吵吵嚷嚷的黑旅店吗
What kind of vengeful bed and breakfast do you think I'm running?

273
00:16:21,570 --> 00:16:25,110
我们一起生活了13年  你怎么能对我如此狠心
We lived together 13 years.How can you be so awful to me?

274
00:16:25,280 --> 00:16:28,490
我狠心吗  你才是在我心上用力开一枪的人
I'm being awful?! You're the one who went out of your way to hurt me.

275
00:16:28,660 --> 00:16:30,030
那是因为你太自私了
Because you were being selfish.

276
00:16:30,240 --> 00:16:32,240
和你分财产可是件难事呢
Dividing our belongings is difficult.

277
00:16:32,450 --> 00:16:34,290
有什么难的  我什么都不想要
Why? I said I didn't care!

278
00:16:34,500 --> 00:16:35,790
打扰一下
Excuse me.

279
00:16:36,040 --> 00:16:37,290
虽然不关我的事
It's none of my business,

280
00:16:37,460 --> 00:16:41,380
不过听起来你们的怒气都是由爱而生的
but it sounds like a lot of this anger is coming from love.

281
00:16:44,760 --> 00:16:47,050
我谢谢你全家  没人要你说话
Yeah, thanks, but nobody asked you.

282
00:16:47,300 --> 00:16:49,720
不管怎样我还是要说下去
Well, I'm just gonna keep on talking.

283
00:16:51,560 --> 00:16:57,390
看起来  随着谢尔顿搬走  你们的生活进入了一个新的阶段
Seems like, with Sheldon moving out,you're in a new phase of your lives

284
00:16:58,150 --> 00:17:03,480
而大吵大闹简单过  面对彼此的真感情
and it's easier to fight than to face the feelings that you have for one another.

285
00:17:06,780 --> 00:17:08,410
我觉得他说得有道理
I think he might be right.

286
00:17:08,740 --> 00:17:10,200
另外  这位高人是谁啊
Also, who is that?

287
00:17:12,870 --> 00:17:14,250
我必须承认
I have to admit,

288
00:17:14,620 --> 00:17:18,580
与你分开  和艾米同居比我想象中要难得多
leaving you to move in with Amy has been harder than I thought it would be.

289
00:17:18,960 --> 00:17:21,750
对我也一样  你走了  一切都不同了
Well, for me, too.It's not the same with you gone.

290
00:17:21,920 --> 00:17:23,840
如果你想找个新室友...
If you're looking for a new guy to live with...

291
00:17:24,000 --> 00:17:25,380
-没门  -不用了  谢谢
-No! - We're good. Thank you.

292
00:17:27,420 --> 00:17:29,260
没人打算回答我吗  好吧
So, no one's gonna tell me? Okay.

293
00:17:30,470 --> 00:17:33,640
莱纳德  我希望能停止这场财产争夺之战
Leonard, I would like us to stop fighting about our possessions.

294
00:17:34,100 --> 00:17:35,470
举双手同意
Well, I'd like that, too.

295
00:17:35,680 --> 00:17:38,770
我希望你能保留我们的公寓旗
In fact, I want you to keep the apartment flag,

296
00:17:39,100 --> 00:17:41,270
我这么说并不仅仅是因为你用生殖器磨蹭过它
and I'm not just saying that because it touched your genitals.

297
00:17:43,360 --> 00:17:44,650
-你说真的吗  -我保证
-You promise?  -I do.

298
00:17:44,860 --> 00:17:46,900
为了表示我内心真的没有芥蒂
And to show you that there are no hard feelings,

299
00:17:47,110 --> 00:17:50,410
我还愿意用我的生殖器磨蹭那旗子
I am willing to rub my genitals on it as well.

300
00:17:51,280 --> 00:17:55,910
哎哟喂  说到用鸟磨蹭东西  这可是我的强项
Well...if we're rubbing genitals on things, that's where I shine.

301
00:18:03,920 --> 00:18:05,380
左边往下点
Little lower to the left.

302
00:18:07,130 --> 00:18:08,590
再往下点
A little more.

303
00:18:09,760 --> 00:18:10,970
好了吗
Is it good?

304
00:18:11,140 --> 00:18:12,970
没用  还是丑得犯罪
No, still hideous.

305
00:18:17,890 --> 00:18:20,980
我相信不久的将来  我们就会完全忽略它的存在了
Well, I'm sure at some point,we won't even notice it's there.

306
00:18:21,190 --> 00:18:24,900
你想得挺美  但不久它就会出现在你的噩梦里
Yeah, you'd think that,but after a while it starts showing up in your dreams.

307
00:18:26,690 --> 00:18:28,990
我觉得它有画龙点睛之妙
I think it brings the room together.

308
00:18:31,820 --> 00:18:33,780
明天谁愿意粉刷婴儿室
Hey, tomorrow who wants to paint the nursery?

309
00:18:33,990 --> 00:18:34,990
我做
I'll do it.

